{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-routing","title":"基于延迟/健康的全球流量调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multiregion-search-architecture/failover-routing/latency-routing","wordCount":2486,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于延迟-健康的全球流量调度\">基于延迟/健康的全球流量调度</h1><p>故障切换处理的是&quot;某区域挂了&quot;这类事件，而常态调度处理的是一个持续存在的优化问题：在没有故障的情况下，全球流量也应该被持续地按实时延迟与健康度在多个可用区域之间重新分配。这看似只是&quot;调权重&quot;，但延迟该怎么测、健康度该怎么定义、权重该以什么节奏调整，每一个问题都有让系统变坏的做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>全球流量调度的目标函数不是&quot;最小化平均延迟&quot;，而是<strong>在容量约束下最小化用户可感知的延迟</strong>。这个区别很关键：一个纯延迟最优的策略会把所有流量压向延迟最低的区域直到它过载，随后该区域的延迟飙升，全局表现反而更差。因此调度实际上求解的是一个带约束的分配问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_i w_i \\hat{L}\\_i \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad w_i \\le \\frac{C_i - U_i}{T} \\ \\ \\forall i, \\ \\ \\sum_i w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.638em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是区域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的容量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是它的既有负载，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是总请求量。约束条件把&quot;容量上限&quot;变成了权重的硬上界，这使得调度不会把任何区域压垮。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>失效后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{L}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>提供优化方向</td>\n<td>误导流量到错误区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i - U_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>防止过载</td>\n<td>低延迟区被压垮，全局劣化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康判定</td>\n<td>可行性过滤</td>\n<td>流量打向劣化区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调整节奏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>抑制振荡</td>\n<td>权重反复摆动，缓存抖动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  M[延迟矩阵] --&gt; O[优化器]&#10;  K[容量余量] --&gt; O&#10;  H[健康判定] --&gt; O&#10;  O --&gt; W[区域权重]&#10;  W --&gt; S[调度执行]&#10;  S --&gt; M2[观测延迟反馈]&#10;  M2 --&gt;|EWMA 平滑| M\">graph LR\n  M[延迟矩阵] --&gt; O[优化器]\n  K[容量余量] --&gt; O\n  H[健康判定] --&gt; O\n  O --&gt; W[区域权重]\n  W --&gt; S[调度执行]\n  S --&gt; M2[观测延迟反馈]\n  M2 --&gt;|EWMA 平滑| M</pre><h2 id=\"调度决策的三个输入\">调度决策的三个输入</h2><p>决定一个用户请求去哪个区域，可用的信息有三类，它们的可靠性与时效性差异很大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>时效性</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络拓扑距离</td>\n<td>来源 IP 的地理/ASN 映射</td>\n<td>静态（天到周）</td>\n<td>中（VPN、代理会失真）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实测往返延迟</td>\n<td>主动探测或历史请求统计</td>\n<td>秒到分钟</td>\n<td>高（直接反映）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后端健康度</td>\n<td>区域集群的容量/错误率</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>高（但需判定窗口）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[请求] --&gt; G[全局调度]&#10;  G --&gt; I1[拓扑距离&lt;br/&gt;粗定位]&#10;  G --&gt; I2[实测延迟&lt;br/&gt;精调]&#10;  G --&gt; I3[健康度&lt;br/&gt;可行性过滤]&#10;  I1 --&gt; W[候选区域 + 权重]&#10;  I2 --&gt; W&#10;  I3 --&gt; W&#10;  W --&gt; S[选中区域]\">graph TD\n  R[请求] --&gt; G[全局调度]\n  G --&gt; I1[拓扑距离&lt;br/&gt;粗定位]\n  G --&gt; I2[实测延迟&lt;br/&gt;精调]\n  G --&gt; I3[健康度&lt;br/&gt;可行性过滤]\n  I1 --&gt; W[候选区域 + 权重]\n  I2 --&gt; W\n  I3 --&gt; W\n  W --&gt; S[选中区域]</pre><p><strong>拓扑距离是最先被使用的输入，也是最不可靠的。</strong> 它成本最低（只需查表），但会因为 VPN、企业代理、移动网络出口聚合而严重失真——一个在德国的用户可能因为使用某运营商的企业代理而从新加坡出口。因此纯基于地理位置的调度在实践中会有 5%–15% 的请求被导向明显更远的区域。这部分损失必须靠实测延迟来纠正。</p>\n<p><strong>实测延迟是最直接的信号，但采集方式有讲究。</strong> 它有两个来源：客户端主动上报（页面加载时测量到各区域入口的 RTT，随下一次请求带上）和服务端观测（从请求的 TCP 握手时间、TLS 协商时间推算）。前者精确但引入额外探测开销且可能被伪造，后者零成本但只反映&quot;上次选择的那个区域&quot;的延迟，对未选择的区域没有信息——这是典型的<strong>探索与利用</strong>问题。</p>\n<p><strong>健康度是硬约束而非优化目标。</strong> 无论延迟多低，不健康的区域都不能被选中。它与前两个输入的关系是&quot;先过滤再排序&quot;，而不是加权求和。把健康度当作一个可被延迟优势抵消的权重，会导致流量持续打向正在劣化的区域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟探测-被动统计与主动探测\">延迟探测：被动统计与主动探测</h2><p>两种探测方式各有盲区，实践中必须组合。</p>\n<p><strong>被动统计</strong>利用真实请求的时序数据：从服务端记录每个 <code>(源区域, 目标区域)</code> 组合的 P50/P95/P99 延迟，作为调度权重的依据。它的盲区是<strong>只能看到被选中的路径</strong>——如果调度一直把德国用户导向法兰克福，就永远不会知道阿姆斯特丹其实更快。这个盲区在正常的稳定状态下影响不大（说明当前选择确实是好的），但在链路变化时会滞后很久才被发现。</p>\n<p><strong>主动探测</strong>由分布在各区域的探针节点周期性地互相测量 RTT 与丢包率，建立一张完整的延迟矩阵。它能看到所有路径，代价是探测流量成本与&quot;探测结果与真实用户体验的偏差&quot;（探针的网络路径可能与用户的不同）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>覆盖</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>偏差来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>被动统计</td>\n<td>仅已选路径</td>\n<td>零附加成本</td>\n<td>采样偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动探测</td>\n<td>全路径矩阵</td>\n<td>探测流量</td>\n<td>探针网络路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端上报</td>\n<td>真实用户视角</td>\n<td>需客户端配合</td>\n<td>可伪造、需抽样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐组合是：<strong>以被动统计为主（覆盖多数流量、零成本），用主动探测补全矩阵（发现被忽略的更优路径），用客户端上报做抽样校验（发现系统性偏差）</strong>。三者的数据在调度器中融合时，需要注意采样权重——客户端上报的样本是有偏的（只有愿意配合的客户端才有数据），不能与被动统计等权合并。</p>\n<p>一个具体的探索策略是<strong>保留少量探索流量</strong>：把 1%–3% 的请求按轮转方式导向非最优候选区域，用这些样本来更新延迟矩阵。这就像推荐系统的 explore 预算，成本可控但能持续发现链路变化。探索比例需要抑制——如果探索流量正好落在某个容量吃紧的区域，会引发真实的用户体验问题，因此探索目标必须排除健康度处于边缘的区域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权重控制与调整节奏\">权重控制与调整节奏</h2><p>调度权重的调整节奏决定了系统的稳定性，这是最容易被忽视的参数。</p>\n<p><strong>调整过快</strong>会导致振荡：延迟测量本身有噪声，如果每次采样都立即调整权重，流量会在两个区域之间反复摆动，每个周期都伴随缓存失效。<strong>调整过慢</strong>会在链路劣化时反应迟钝。合理的时间常数通常在<strong>数十秒到数分钟</strong>量级，且应当与测量窗口的长度匹配——测量窗口 1 分钟、调整间隔 10 秒，等于对噪声做过度反应。</p>\n<p>实用的做法是**指数加权移动平均（EWMA）**作为延迟估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{L}_{t+1} = (1 - \\beta) \\hat{L}_t + \\beta \\cdot L_{obs}, \\quad \\beta \\in [0.05, 0.2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1551em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 越小越平滑、越迟钝。跨区域调度通常取较小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>（0.05–0.1），因为跨区链路的延迟基线变化缓慢，噪声却大。</p>\n<p>权重与延迟的关系不是线性的，常见做法是<strong>按延迟的倒数或幂次分配</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>γ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mi>γ</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\frac{1 / \\hat{L}_i^{\\gamma}}{\\sum_j 1 / \\hat{L}_j^{\\gamma}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8964em;vertical-align:-1.2726em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6238em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1632em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2726em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制激进度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时全部平均分配（完全不看延迟），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 很大时会全部压向最低延迟区域（容易过载）。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 1–2 并配合<strong>容量上限</strong>约束——任何区域的权重不得超过其可用容量的对应份额。容量约束的存在很重要，否则低延迟区域会被压垮，反而使全局延迟上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度决策的可解释性与回放\">调度决策的可解释性与回放</h2><p>生产环境里&quot;为什么这个用户被导向了那个区域&quot;很难回答，而这个问题的答案对排障与合规审计都很重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[请求] --&gt; D[调度器]&#10;  D --&gt; L[记录决策上下文]&#10;  L --&gt; C1[候选区域与权重]&#10;  L --&gt; C2[各区域延迟估计]&#10;  L --&gt; C3[健康度判定]&#10;  L --&gt; C4[命中的规则/约束]&#10;  C1 --&gt; E[决策日志]&#10;  C2 --&gt; E&#10;  C3 --&gt; E&#10;  C4 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; A[可回放: 用同一上下文复现决策]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[请求] --&gt; D[调度器]\n  D --&gt; L[记录决策上下文]\n  L --&gt; C1[候选区域与权重]\n  L --&gt; C2[各区域延迟估计]\n  L --&gt; C3[健康度判定]\n  L --&gt; C4[命中的规则/约束]\n  C1 --&gt; E[决策日志]\n  C2 --&gt; E\n  C3 --&gt; E\n  C4 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; A[可回放: 用同一上下文复现决策]</pre><p>需要记录的最小上下文包含四项：候选集合、每个候选的权重与依据、健康度判定结果、以及最终命中哪个约束（例如&quot;因容量上限被截断&quot;）。有了这些，决策就能被回放复现——用同一份上下文重跑调度逻辑，若结果不同则说明调度器有非确定性或版本不一致。</p>\n<p>合规视角下这个记录的另一个用途是证明<strong>数据未被错误地跨境处理</strong>：如果某次查询被导向了错误的区域，需要有证据说明这是故障兜底（有授权）而不是配置错误（违规）。这个区分在审计中很关键（见 <a href=\"../data-sovereignty/pii-boundary\">用户行为数据跨境边界</a>）。</p>\n<p>需要注意的是，决策日志本身也包含个人数据（用户来源与去向），它的保留策略与存储位置必须遵守同一套驻留规则，不能为了排障便利把它集中到一处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调度决策有三个输入：拓扑距离（成本低但会因 VPN/代理失真）、实测延迟（最直接但采集有盲区）、健康度（硬约束而非权重）。</li>\n<li>三种延迟探测方式各有盲区：被动统计只见已选路径、主动探测受探针网络路径影响、客户端上报可伪造且有采样偏差，三者需组合并注意合并时的样本权重。</li>\n<li>保留 1%–3% 的探索流量可以发现被忽略的更优路径，但探索目标必须排除健康度处于边缘的区域。</li>\n<li>权重调整节奏需与测量窗口匹配，过快会振荡、过慢会迟钝，延迟估计用 EWMA（跨区域调度取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta \\approx 0.05\\text{–}0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>权重按延迟倒数或幂次分配（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 1–2），但必须叠加容量上限约束，否则低延迟区域会被压垮。</li>\n<li>调度决策必须记录可回放的上下文（候选、权重、健康度、命中约束），它既用于排障也用于证明跨境处理是故障兜底而非配置错误；决策日志本身同样受驻留规则约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于延迟/健康的全球流量调度","id":"基于延迟-健康的全球流量调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调度决策的三个输入","id":"调度决策的三个输入"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟探测：被动统计与主动探测","id":"延迟探测-被动统计与主动探测"},{"level":2,"text":"权重控制与调整节奏","id":"权重控制与调整节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"调度决策的可解释性与回放","id":"调度决策的可解释性与回放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"区域故障切换与跨区兜底","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multiregion-search-architecture/failover-routing/region-failover"},"next":{"title":"搜索配置按区域灰度发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multiregion-search-architecture/failover-routing/regional-rollout"}}